window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>From </b><b><i>USA Today</i></b><b> best-selling author Rebecca Hefner</b></p> <p><b>Before the end of hatred, there was the dawn of peace…</b></p> <p>Two immortals from warring species save each other’s lives as the conflict rages on.</p> <p>Alrec, the hulking Vampyre warrior, spares her first.</p> <p>Years later, Kilani, the fierce, uncompromising Slayer, returns the favor.</p> <p>Stuck in her remote cabin, their bond grows as Kilani warily nurses her injured Vampyre, determined to deny her growing desire for the man with deep, knowing eyes and mesmerizing fangs.</p> <p>And, of course, there’s only one bed…</p> <p><b>The sizzling prequel to the Etherya’s Earth paranormal romance saga.</b></p> <p><b>This novella is brought to you by an author who adores her fans and always wanted to write a prequel for the series that launched her career. Written for both current and new listeners, this steamy, heartfelt story has brand-new characters and a happily ever after.</b></p>"; 
